<title>USA: American Air talks to continue.</title>
<headline>American Air talks to continue.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Contract talks between American Airlines and its pilots are expected to continue through the weekend, the two sides said on Friday.</p>
<p>Representatives of American, a unit of AMR Corp, and Allied Pilots Association met on Friday to resume talks for the first time in four weeks.</p>
<p>The union said it had no indication whether any progress had been made in the session.</p>
<p>&quot;Talks are expected to continue throughout the weekend at the discretion of Robert Harris,&quot; a union spokesman said.</p>
</text>
